Node ID=5 viola
Text=It is one of Leonardo's newest inventions, a musical instrument both of string and bow, a mystical device that sings to heaven with each note! When Leonardo drafted the design, I begged him to let me help with its creation, to be a *part* of it, and be one with its song. I have been here since, still entranced with the viola organista.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=5 other questions
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=5 talking organ
Text=My voice rings louder for those with a desire to create and compose. I am a *muse*, a spirit of artistic expression. When Leonardo crafted the viola organista, I was drawn to it like bees to honey, seeking the sweetness of this wondrous instrument.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=5 other questions
Is Default Reply=1
